<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First USA a weekly favorite.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First USA a weekly favorite.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it named First USA Inc its &quot;Focus One&quot; stock of the week on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- First USA shares closed at 56-7/8 on Tuesday.</p>
